///
/// Typically implemented by a [State] of a widget that builds an
/// [EditableText].À#HÀ#IÀ4¤'À4©␀À4ÇÀ6m€¨À6ş€‡/// Whether the Shift key was pressed when the most recent [PointerDownEvent]
